{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Water 是一款以真實流體表面呈現每日飲水進度的喝水追蹤工具，畫面會隨手機傾斜而晃動，每次記錄時亦會泛起漣漪。它適合想在不受干擾的簡潔介面中養成穩定補水習慣的人，原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>紀錄飲水與智能提醒</h2>\n<p>每次補水只需一按即可記錄，也可使用自訂快捷鍵輸入精確份量；智能提醒會按尚欠水量溫和推送。所有紀錄按日分類，支援滑動刪除，並可在月曆檢視進度環，了解飲水習慣的穩定性。單位可在毫升與盎司之間切換，個人資料亦有助設定每日目標，配合原生 iOS 設計，操作流暢。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-166-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-167-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-168-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-169-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-170-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Water – Hydration Reminder</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-19T11:28:58.494524+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":308,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}